  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hands-on assistance to BIH to address the issue of persons missing from 1990s conflict and actions toward a sustainable domestic process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Direct grant to International Commission on Missing Persons (ICMP) - IPA 2022 1 year bridging project&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ICMP&#xbf;s technical assistance includes anthropological and archaeological work at excavations, examination and re-association of recovered mortal remains, DNA sampling, testing, providing access to ICMP&#xbf;s DNA laboratories and matching biological samples (living relatives-victims). However, the full scope of this assistance ranges from mentioned technical assistance, institution building, capacity building and the creation of specific laws and by-laws, to public advocacy and memoralization.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
